{"sections":[{"slug":"MoravaK-理论","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"MoravaK-理论"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“Morava K-<span lang=\"zh\">理论</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“Morava K-理论”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于素数</span> $p$, Morava K-<span lang=\"zh\">理论是一列复定向上同调理论</span> $K(n)$,\n$$\r\n\\pi_\\bullet(K(n))\\simeq\\mathbb F_p[v_n,v_n^{-1}],\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $v_n$ <span lang=\"zh\">的阶数为</span> $2(p^n-1)$.</p>\n<p>$K(n)$ <span lang=\"zh\">具有</span> $MU_{(p)}$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/A∞-代数","text":"A∞-<span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">结构</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/MU","text":"MU"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}